 "remarks": "Light, space and exceptional convenience define this updated and beautifully maintained townhouse at Middlesex Commons. Ideal proximity to town, Metro North and Whole Foods. Enjoy all that will be offered when the Corbin District is complete with fantastic shopping, dining and gathering spaces!  An inviting foyer opens to the large living and dining room, where soaring two-story windows fill the space with natural light. A fireplace creates a warm focal point, while sliding doors lead to a private, west-facing deck overlooking the community's beautifully landscaped open space-an ideal spot to enjoy the afternoon sun and evening sunsets.  The bright eat-in kitchen enjoys southeastern exposure and wonderful morning light. Upstairs, the spacious primary suite features a cathedral ceiling with half moon window, private balcony, and generous bath with separate tub and shower. The second bedroom also offers a cathedral ceiling with half moon window, along with its own full bath. An extended hallway provides an efficient home office space. An additional bonus room on the third floor allows for a multitude of uses; another home office, guest quarters and plenty of storage!  Set on eleven beautifully maintained acres, Middlesex Commons offers sweeping lawns, a picturesque pond, heated saltwater pool and pool house, as well as a charming guest cottage available for visitors.",
